# Per-file verification journals are regenerable and large (~10-12 MB each):
# re-running verify_snapshot_v2.py against the same snapshot reproduces them.
# The durable evidence - verification-report.json, SHA256SUMS.txt,
# duplicates.json, run-manifest.json and verify.log - IS tracked.
journal.jsonl

# Full per-file integrity_scan reports carry one entry per file scanned - 10.4 MB
# for the 28,993-file source 1 snapshot - and are reproduced by re-running
# integrity_scan.py against the same path. The summary written alongside them
# (01_integrity_scan_summary.json: coverage, findings, flagged files, verdict)
# IS tracked.
*_perfile.json
